<title>USA: U.S. DEBT FUTURES WEAK HEADING INTO CLOSE.</title>
<headline>U.S. DEBT FUTURES WEAK HEADING INTO CLOSE.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 7 - U.S. debt futures were weak heading into the day's close. September T-bond fell to a more than 2-week low, just shy of support at the low from July 22 at 114-4/32. Traders said thin market, nervous trade, a few big sellers started the slide. One analyst said a close below 114-21/32 would be negative.</p>
